<h1 style="font-size:26px;font-weight:900;color:#1a202c;margin:0 0 8px;letter-spacing:-0.5px;">Verify your email</h1>
<p style="color:#718096;font-size:15px;margin:0 0 24px;">Hi <strong>{{firstName}}</strong> — one quick step to secure your SentinelFi® account.</p>

<div class="alert-success">
  <strong>🔐 Email verification required</strong> — your link expires in <strong>{{expiryHours}} hours</strong>.
</div>

<div style="text-align:center;margin:28px 0;">
