</div>

<p style="color:#a0aec0;font-size:12px;text-align:center;">
  Button not working? Paste this link in your browser:<br/>
  <a href="{{verificationUrl}}" style="color:#00A3B5;word-break:break-all;">{{verificationUrl}}</a>
</p>
